#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Ashen Tree[/color] in Woodcutting which provide "
"[color=#FFD16D]Ashen Logs[/color] used in various areas of the game."
msgstr ""
"Débloque l'[color=#FFD16D]arbre cendré[/color] en Coupe de bois, qui fournit"
" des [color=#FFD16D]bûches cendrées[/color] utilisées dans de nombreux "
"domaines du jeu."

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dense Cave Trail"
msgstr "Piste de la Grotte dense"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Dense Coal Rock[/color] in Mining which is a much"
" more efficient source of [color=#FFD16D]Coal[/color]."
msgstr ""
"Débloque la [color=#FFD16D]roche de charbon dense[/color] en Exp. minière, "
"une source de [color=#FFD16D]charbon[/color] bien plus efficace."

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Torag Grounds Trail"
msgstr "Piste des Terres des Torag"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Torag Grounds[/color] Location in Hunting, "
"allowing you to hunt [color=#FFD16D]Torag[/color] which drop materials for "
"high-level gear."
msgstr ""
"Débloque le lieu [color=#FFD16D]Terres des Torag[/color] en Chasse, qui vous"
" permet de chasser les [color=#FFD16D]Torag[/color], dont les matériaux "
"servent à fabriquer de l'équipement de haut niveau."

