#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to observe [color=#FFD16D]Meteor Shower[/color] and "
"[color=#FFD16D]Starfall[/color] events in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"Débloque la possibilité d'observer les événements [color=#FFD16D]Pluie de "
"météores[/color] et [color=#FFD16D]Chute d'étoiles[/color] en Feu de camp"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to obtain [color=#FFD16D]Fireflies[/color] while burning"
" Logs in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"Débloque la possibilité d'obtenir des [color=#FFD16D]lucioles[/color] en "
"brûlant des bûches en Feu de camp"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Offerings[/color] toggle in Beastcrafting for "
"Beast Weapons and Beast Armour, allowing you to offer your crafted Item in "
"return for a potential gift."
msgstr ""
"Débloque l'option [color=#FFD16D]Offrandes astrales[/color] en Façonnage "
"bestial pour les armes bestiales et l'armure bestiale, qui vous permet "
"d'offrir l'objet fabriqué en échange d'un éventuel cadeau."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Sacrificial Anvil[/color] in Smithing, allowing "
"you to sacrifice your smithed item in return for extra Skill XP, GP or a "
"rare Collectable"
msgstr ""
"Débloque l'[color=#FFD16D]enclume sacrificielle[/color] en Métallurgie, qui "
"vous permet de sacrifier l'objet forgé en échange d'XP de compétence, de PO "
"ou d'un objet de collection rare supplémentaires"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Smelting -> Star Forge[/color] in Smithing, "
"allowing to you create Alloy Bars such as Ironsteel or Dragonrune"
msgstr ""
"Débloque [color=#FFD16D]Fonte > Forge stellaire[/color] en Métallurgie, qui "
"vous permet de créer des lingots d'alliage comme le fer-acier ou la rune-"
"dragon"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Jewellery[/color] in Crafting"
msgstr "Débloque les [color=#FFD16D]bijoux astraux[/color] en Artisanat"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Night Sprints[/color] in Agility."
msgstr "Débloque les [color=#FFD16D]sprints nocturnes[/color] en Agilité."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Catalyst Toolbelt Slot[/color] in Herblore"
msgstr ""
"Débloque l'[color=#FFD16D]emplacement de ceinture à outils "
"Catalyseur[/color] en Herboristerie"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Observation"
msgid_plural "Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation"
msgstr[1] "Observations"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You study the stars carefully, but they remain silent."
msgstr ""
"Vous étudiez attentivement les étoiles, mais elles restent silencieuses."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation offers no insight this time."
msgstr "Cette fois, la constellation ne vous apporte aucune révélation."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever message the stars held has slipped away."
msgstr "Le message que portaient les étoiles s'est évanoui."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You sense a faint presence among the stars, but it quickly fades."
msgstr ""
"Vous percevez une faible présence parmi les étoiles, mais elle s'estompe "
"vite."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation's light flickers without revealing its secrets."
msgstr "La lumière de la constellation vacille sans révéler ses secrets."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wait patiently for a sign, but none arrives."
msgstr "Vous attendez patiemment un signe, mais rien ne vient."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You almost discern a message before it vanishes from your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Vous discernez presque un message avant qu'il ne s'efface de vos pensées."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation politely declines to elaborate."
msgstr "La constellation refuse poliment d'en dire plus."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You feel certain the stars judged your attempt. They offer no further "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes certain que les étoiles ont jugé votre tentative. Elles n'ajoutent"
" aucun commentaire."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even the stars have off days."
msgstr "Même les étoiles ont leurs mauvais jours."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You continue to observe the stars, confirming that they are indeed stars."
msgstr ""
"Vous continuez d'observer les étoiles et confirmez qu'il s'agit bien "
"d'étoiles."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Deedree Observation"
msgid_plural "Deedree Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Deedree"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Deedree"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that talking to plants helps. They refuse to comment on "
"whether the plants listen."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles affirment que parler aux plantes les aide. Elles refusent de "
"dire si les plantes écoutent."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation warns that the tallest tree always wins an argument with a"
" blunt axe."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous prévient que le plus grand arbre gagne toujours une "
"dispute contre une hache émoussée."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that weeds are simply crops with exceptional confidence."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que les mauvaises herbes ne sont que des cultures "
"dotées d'une confiance exceptionnelle."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest that planting today is wiser than promising you'll plant "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles suggèrent qu'il est plus sage de planter aujourd'hui que de "
"promettre de planter demain."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every mighty Oak Tree was once a seed that ignored "
"terrible advice."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que chaque Chêne puissant fut autrefois une graine "
"qui a ignoré de terribles conseils."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars quietly remind you that chopping the tree before collecting the "
"fruit is rarely the optimal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous rappellent discrètement qu'abattre l'arbre avant de "
"cueillir les fruits est rarement la stratégie optimale."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Terra Observation"
msgid_plural "Terra Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Terra"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Terra"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why you're not mining Coal right now."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent pourquoi vous n'êtes pas en train d'extraire du "
"Charbon."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that hitting the rock harder is a valid mining strategy."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles insistent : frapper la roche plus fort est une stratégie minière"
" valable."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellations insists you are one Geode away from finding that rare "
"item."
msgstr ""
"La constellation insiste : vous n'êtes plus qu'à une Géode de trouver cet "
"objet rare."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder how staring at them all night helps build Strength."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent en quoi les fixer toute la nuit vous aide à "
"développer votre Force."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that a high Strength level won't save you from"
" the Coal mines."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous rappelle qu'un niveau de Force élevé ne vous sauvera "
"pas des mines de Charbon."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars stare back at you."
msgstr "Les étoiles vous fixent en retour."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ameria Observation"
msgid_plural "Ameria Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation d'Ameria"
msgstr[1] "Observations d'Ameria"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars whisper that fish are far less cooperative once they realize "
"they're on the menu."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles murmurent que les poissons coopèrent beaucoup moins une fois "
"qu'ils comprennent qu'ils sont au menu."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest drying your firewood before complaining that it won't "
"burn."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous suggèrent de faire sécher votre bois avant de vous plaindre"
" qu'il ne brûle pas."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that cooking the fish is generally easier "
"after you've caught it."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous rappelle qu'il est généralement plus facile de "
"cuisiner le poisson après l'avoir attrapé."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that a warm campfire has ended more adventures "
"than any monster."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme qu'un bon feu de camp a mis fin à plus d'aventures "
"que n'importe quel monstre."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a secluded stream within the Shrapnel River."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous guident vers un ruisseau isolé dans la Rivière de débris."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Stream "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne accès au lieu de pêche Ruisseau au"
" clair de lune.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgid_plural "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgstr[0] "Crique de minuit d'Ameria"
msgstr[1] "Crique de minuit d'Ameria"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a hidden spot along the Windy Coastline."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous guident vers un endroit caché le long de la Côte venteuse."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Midnight Cove "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne accès au lieu de pêche Crique de "
"minuit.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ceedyr Observation"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Ceedyr"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Ceedyr"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every perfect hide once belonged to something that "
"strongly preferred keeping it."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que chaque peau parfaite a appartenu à une créature"
" qui tenait beaucoup à la garder."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why creatures are so attached to materials you "
"clearly need for crafting."
msgstr ""
"La constellation se demande pourquoi les créatures tiennent tant à des "
"matériaux dont vous avez clairement besoin pour l'artisanat."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that chasing wildlife is considerably easier without "
"carrying half your workshop."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous rappellent qu'il est bien plus facile de poursuivre la "
"faune sans transporter la moitié de votre atelier."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that \"I'll just hunt one more\" has misled countless "
"adventurers."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles insistent : « Je chasse juste une dernière fois » a égaré "
"d'innombrables aventuriers."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals that collecting \"just in case\" materials "
"eventually becomes a storage problem."
msgstr ""
"La constellation révèle que les matériaux gardés « au cas où » finissent "
"toujours par devenir un problème de stockage."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgid_plural "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgstr[0] "Collines au clair de lune de Ceedyr"
msgstr[1] "Collines au clair de lune de Ceedyr"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation lights a path towards a hidden opening in the Hills."
msgstr ""
"La constellation éclaire un chemin vers une ouverture cachée dans les "
"collines."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Hills "
"Hunting Location.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne accès au lieu de chasse Collines "
"au clair de lune.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgid_plural "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgstr[0] "Lac du Croissant d'Iridan"
msgstr[1] "Lac du Croissant d'Iridan"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation points toward a tranquil lake where the water curves like "
"a crescent moon. A hidden shoreline beckons those willing to seek it."
msgstr ""
"La constellation désigne un lac paisible dont l'eau s'incurve comme un "
"croissant de lune. Un rivage caché attire ceux qui sont prêts à le chercher."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Crescent Lake "
"Combat Area.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne accès à la zone de combat Lac du "
"Croissant.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Iridan Observation"
msgid_plural "Iridan Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation d'Iridan"
msgstr[1] "Observations d'Iridan"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim that yelling while attacking increases accuracy."
msgstr "Les étoiles affirment que crier en attaquant augmente la précision."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that every dent in your armour is a valuable lesson. "
"Preferably someone else's lesson."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles vous rappellent que chaque bosse sur votre armure est une "
"précieuse leçon. De préférence la leçon de quelqu'un d'autre."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims that missing your target is not a valid strategy."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que rater votre cible n'est pas une stratégie "
"valable."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim every unique weapon began life as \"good enough for now.\""
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles affirment que chaque arme unique a commencé sa vie comme « "
"suffisante pour l'instant »."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that hitting harder is a perfectly valid strategy."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles insistent : frapper plus fort est une stratégie parfaitement "
"valable."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Syllia Observation"
msgid_plural "Syllia Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Syllia"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Syllia"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every arrow flies true until the wind develops a "
"personality."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que chaque flèche vole droit jusqu'à ce que le vent"
" se découvre une personnalité."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars suggest aiming before celebrating the shot."
msgstr "Les étoiles vous suggèrent de viser avant de célébrer le tir."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that trees rarely volunteer to become arrows."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous rappelle que les arbres se portent rarement "
"volontaires pour devenir des flèches."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder why arrows are always found in the most inconvenient "
"places."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent pourquoi les flèches se retrouvent toujours aux "
"endroits les moins pratiques."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a quiver is merely a very organised collection of "
"future mistakes."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme qu'un carquois n'est qu'une collection très "
"organisée d'erreurs futures."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation advises remembering that boomerangs are designed to "
"return."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous conseille de ne pas oublier que les boomerangs sont "
"conçus pour revenir."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Haemir Observation"
msgid_plural "Haemir Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation d'Haemir"
msgstr[1] "Observations d'Haemir"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Placeholder to replace."
msgstr "Texte provisoire à remplacer."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Arachi Observation"
msgid_plural "Arachi Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation d'Arachi"
msgstr[1] "Observations d'Arachi"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that every spell is perfectly safe until proven otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles insistent : chaque sort est parfaitement sûr jusqu'à preuve du "
"contraire."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why wizards keep writing things down when they can"
" barely read their own spellbooks."
msgstr ""
"La constellation se demande pourquoi les magiciens continuent de tout noter "
"alors qu'ils arrivent à peine à lire leurs propres grimoires."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The heavens insist that magical explosions are merely enthusiastic "
"successes."
msgstr ""
"Les cieux insistent : les explosions magiques ne sont que des réussites "
"enthousiastes."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every great mage has accidentally cast something they "
"absolutely didn't mean to."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que chaque grand mage a déjà lancé par accident un sort"
" qu'il ne voulait absolument pas lancer."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that staring at it all night won't solve your "
"Rune supply problems."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous rappelle que la fixer toute la nuit ne résoudra pas "
"vos problèmes d'approvisionnement en Runes."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Arachi"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Arachi"
msgstr[0] "Savoir astral d'Arachi"
msgstr[1] "Savoirs astraux d'Arachi"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You somehow learn a new form of Magic by simply looking at the stars and "
"pretending to read them or something lol."
msgstr ""
"Vous apprenez on ne sait comment une nouvelle forme de Magie en regardant "
"simplement les étoiles et en faisant semblant de les lire, ou un truc du "
"genre, lol."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Spells.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne le savoir nécessaire pour utiliser"
" les sorts astraux.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Hyden"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Hyden"
msgstr[0] "Savoir astral d'Hyden"
msgstr[1] "Savoirs astraux d'Hyden"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals an ancient rite. Its celestial words awaken the "
"power of Astral Prayers."
msgstr ""
"La constellation révèle un rite ancien. Ses paroles célestes éveillent le "
"pouvoir des prières astrales."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Prayers.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne le savoir nécessaire pour utiliser"
" les prières astrales.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Hyden Observation"
msgid_plural "Hyden Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation d'Hyden"
msgstr[1] "Observations d'Hyden"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that blessed logs burn brighter than ordinary ones. "
"Coincidence, perhaps."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que les bûches bénies brûlent plus vivement que les "
"ordinaires. Une coïncidence, peut-être."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder who first looked at a pile of bones and thought, \"The gods"
" will love this.\""
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent qui a été le premier à regarder un tas d'os en se "
"disant : « Les dieux vont adorer ça. »"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insist that divine favour cannot be bought. Offerings, "
"however, are gladly accepted."
msgstr ""
"La constellation insiste : la faveur divine ne s'achète pas. Les offrandes, "
"en revanche, sont acceptées avec plaisir."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims the gods have excellent taste in offerings, though "
"their preferences remain oddly specific."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que les dieux ont un excellent goût en matière "
"d'offrandes, bien que leurs préférences restent étrangement précises."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation observes that the gods rarely explain why they like bones."
" They simply do."
msgstr ""
"La constellation remarque que les dieux expliquent rarement pourquoi ils "
"aiment les os. Ils les aiment, tout simplement."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgid_plural "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgstr[0] "Cratère balafré par la lune de Vale"
msgstr[1] "Cratère balafré par la lune de Vale"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal a crater where moonlight never truly fades. Something "
"ancient still stirs within its scar."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent un cratère où le clair de lune ne s'éteint jamais "
"vraiment. Quelque chose d'ancien remue encore dans sa cicatrice."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonscarred "
"Crater Slayer Zone.[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]Cette observation vous donne accès à la zone de Pourfendeur "
"Cratère balafré par la lune.[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Vale Observation"
msgid_plural "Vale Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Vale"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Vale"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder where your ingredients go when you fail to cook something."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent où vont vos ingrédients quand vous ratez une "
"recette."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a hearty meal can solve many problems. The "
"remaining problems usually require a weapon."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme qu'un repas copieux peut résoudre bien des "
"problèmes. Les problèmes restants exigent généralement une arme."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that eating during a battle is a skill worthy of "
"admiration."
msgstr ""
"La constellation insiste : manger en plein combat est un talent digne "
"d'admiration."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that a full stomach is often the first step toward "
"surviving the next encounter."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent qu'un estomac plein est souvent le premier pas pour "
"survivre à la prochaine rencontre."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every meal tastes better after narrowly avoiding "
"defeat."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que chaque repas a meilleur goût après avoir évité "
"la défaite de justesse."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ko Observation"
msgid_plural "Ko Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Ko"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Ko"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims locked doors are merely suggestions."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que les portes verrouillées ne sont que des "
"suggestions."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every graceful landing is built upon countless less "
"graceful ones."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que chaque atterrissage gracieux repose sur "
"d'innombrables atterrissages moins gracieux."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why NPCs cannot pickpocket you as well."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent pourquoi les PNJ ne peuvent pas vous faire les "
"poches eux aussi."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation hints at accepting bribes for more Stealth in return."
msgstr ""
"La constellation laisse entendre qu'accepter des pots-de-vin rapporterait "
"plus de Furtivité."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why a very specific item seems to constantly "
"appear on random routes."
msgstr ""
"La constellation se demande pourquoi un objet bien précis semble apparaître "
"sans cesse sur des parcours aléatoires."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that it cannot assist with your Lockpick "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"La constellation vous rappelle qu'elle ne peut pas vous aider avec votre "
"problème de Crochets."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Tellus Observation"
msgid_plural "Tellus Observations"
msgstr[0] "Observation de Tellus"
msgstr[1] "Observations de Tellus"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that the best defence is letting the monster become someone"
" else's assignment."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles insistent : la meilleure défense consiste à laisser le monstre "
"devenir la tâche de quelqu'un d'autre."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every Slayer task looks reasonable until you "
"actually arrive."
msgstr ""
"La constellation affirme que chaque tâche de Pourfendeur semble raisonnable "
"jusqu'à ce que vous arriviez sur place."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that shields are much easier to repair than confidence."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que les boucliers sont bien plus faciles à réparer que "
"la confiance en soi."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder if Slayer Masters secretly compete to invent increasingly "
"inconvenient tasks."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles se demandent si les maîtres Pourfendeurs rivalisent en secret "
"pour inventer des tâches toujours plus pénibles."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that \"just one more monster\" has delayed many "
"journeys home."
msgstr ""
"La constellation insiste : « Juste un dernier monstre » a retardé bien des "
"retours à la maison."

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every experienced slayer has confidently attacked the "
"wrong monster at least once."
msgstr ""
"Les étoiles révèlent que tout pourfendeur expérimenté a déjà attaqué avec "
"assurance le mauvais monstre au moins une fois."

